# Gym Management System 🏋️‍♂️

**A comprehensive digital platform designed to streamline and automate the daily operations of fitness centers and gyms[cite: 1].**

## 🚀 Overview
The Gym Management System (GMS) is a software-based solution built to help gym managers handle customer relationships, as well as securely store facility and staff data while limiting access to authorized staff only. By centralizing operations, the platform minimizes administrative workloads, eliminates paperwork, and promotes better communication between members and staff.

## 🎯 Key Features
* **Member Management:** Add and manage member details, including personal profiles and fitness activity.
* **Membership Tracking:** Set up different membership packages and automatically track expiry or due dates.
* **Billing & Payments:** Record daily payments, track pending dues, and instantly generate payment receipts.
* **Access Control:** Provide secure login architecture with role-based access privileges for authorized personnel.
* **Reporting & Analytics:** Generate financial summaries and basic reports to quickly view collections and active member status.

## 💻 Tech Stack
*(Note: Please update the technologies below to match your exact project setup)*
* **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (Tailwind CSS / Bootstrap)
* **Backend:** Python (Flask/Django) or Node.js (Express)
* **Database:** MySQL / PostgreSQL
* **Version Control:** Git & GitHub

